           _/_d_e_v_/_p_r_o_t_o_/_p_c_i_0_:_1_:_2_:_0_/_p_c_i_c_f_g

     A legacy floppy controller will have the following device files:

           _/_d_e_v_/_p_r_o_t_o_/_i_s_a_:_0_x_3_f_0_/_0_0_._i_o
